(
    title: "Demon Attack",
    developer: Some("Rob Fulop"),
    description: Some("Winged demons materialize in shimmering waves above your laser cannon, splitting into smaller creatures and diving as the assault deepens. You start with three reserve bunkers — every hit taken costs one, every wave survived untouched banks another — and tracer-shot variations let your fire curve across the screen. Ten variations span solo play, alternating two-player, and a co-op mode that swaps cannon control every four seconds on shared bunkers."),
